{"step_index":1637,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-08T00:43:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-08T09:43:10+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-08T09:43:13+09:00\nThe search for \"\"짱구네 팜\" OR \"짱구네팜\" \"박민수\"\" returned the following summary:\n'짱구네팜'(대표 박민수)은 전라북도 고창군 성내면에 위치한 농식품 업체입니다[1][2].\n\n주요 정보는 다음과 같습니다.\n\n*   **주요 생산품 및 판매:** 구운 단호박, 군고구마, 멜론, 국내산 100% 땅콩버터 등 농산물 및 가공식품을 판매합니다[3][4][5][2].\n*   **관련 활동:** 고창식품산업연구원과 협력하여 단호박 분말 생산성 향상을 위한 공정 개선 사업 등에 참여한 바 있으며[1][2], 타오바오 등을 통한 온라인 판매 활동도 수행하고 있습니다[2].\n*   **연락처:** 010-3160-7654[4][5]\n\nSources:\n[1] [gfi.re.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELmGiiavZC4irS-28fEDh75WdoAUdTGBM6pAuEIuhaMhHhzeaHLOENeq8a_bQ9Xo9H5la2JZzZmx4IrPWzqLE-4dR1xXnu8S8Ql2XmM55-Z4i18XPHWEgEJCyMl96hxHzhJ5zarbe2Vc-dlVshF5_VazcvYkxTeekQQS2p_lgpQAYN2PGfI4xPE6Q20Q==)\n[2] [gfi.re.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELmGiiavZC4irS-28fEDh75WdoAUdTGBM6pAuEIuhaMhHhzeaHLOENeq8a_bQ9Xo9H5la2JZzZmx4IrPWzqLE-4dR1xXnu8S8Ql2XmM55-Z4i18XPHWEgEJCyMl96hxHzhJ5zarbe2Vc-dlVshF5_VazcvYkxTeekQQS2p_lgpQAYN2PGfI4xPE6Q20Q==)\n[3] [incruit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHAbFZx9oAzRT1L5WIuBpgkG3oV9L9hlvGja-O80-P2COg773kN1z-Zr7lUKjgUxxkdAjDItrCGozk6SOe0zPJfmb2kljp3iEmjEzAfALBNgjlGa4Jfx09psg8l3JNx7Rt6HQ==)\n[4] [gochang-market.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFF28pJGuRRDU8nq8G43ttGjgwSpWfbKVU8be8FmJD4iFDvLntR8QcmhLcWaPxN5o0Q6twmwvJdi3NI0HCMGIVd6dQmNttYYGGW5NBu6dmc1LZNOBWo1TiaD31g8dZsFsaST7PT4cY_)\n[5] [firstmall.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGJjh1HA7d7NHhUz_jUj9CG-gxWRtDuEYYzOFGiFikL1TI7ykIXkBMoWoJHxnad9t3dWx2a63FNwPUxHj1hNvSjAIHY0v92uEofTU8pTI4nlkcpbrelfvMjs9z3MZml-jIV2_VZpA==)"}
